{"unit_id":"tag:04I5:proof","translation":"注意，此断言有意义，因为已看到<MATH_0001>及<MATH_0002>为局部赋环的（locally ringed）景（sites），见引理<REF_0001>。此外，知道<MATH_0003>有足够多的点（enough points），见定理<REF_0002>及注记<REF_0003>。因此只需证明<MATH_0004>满足景上的模（Modules on Sites）引理<REF_0004>的条件（3）。为此，取点（point）<MATH_0005>，它属于<MATH_0006>。由引理<REF_0005>，<MATH_0007>对应于几何点（geometric point）<MATH_0008>，它属于<MATH_0009>。由引理<REF_0006>，点（point）<MATH_0010>对应于几何点（geometric point）<MATH_0011>，它属于<MATH_0012>。因此须证明的断言是：所诱导映射（induced map），即茎（stalks）的映射\n<MATH_0013>\n，是局部环（local ring）的映射（map）。设<MATH_0014>为左边的元素（element），它映（maps）到右边极大（maximal）理想（ideal）的某个元素（element）。设<MATH_0015>为三元组（triple）<MATH_0016>的等价类（equivalence class），其中<MATH_0017>平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale），<MATH_0018>位于<MATH_0019>之上，且<MATH_0020>。它映（maps）到\n<MATH_0021>\n的等价类（equivalence class），位于局部环（local ring）<MATH_0022>中。但清楚的是，属于极大（maximal）理想（ideal）意味着将<MATH_0023>拉回（pulling back）到<MATH_0024>的元素（element）时得到零。因此，将<MATH_0025>拉回（pulling back）到<MATH_0026>也为零。这意味着<MATH_0027>位于<MATH_0028>的极大（maximal）理想（ideal）中。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"locally ringed","target_term":"局部赋环的"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"enough points","target_term":"足够多的点"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"induced map","target_term":"诱导映射"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"local ring","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映"},{"source_term":"maximal","target_term":"极大"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"triple","target_term":"三元组"},{"source_term":"equivalence class","target_term":"等价类"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":